        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you. \r\n\r\n4 Bedroom, 1 Bathroom Mid Terrace Family Home \r\nLarge driveway to the front \r\nLow Maintenance Rear garden \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is advised \r\n\r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present 107 Buttercup Park to the Dublin 17 property market \r\n\r\nNestled in a mature and well-established residential development, 107 Buttercup Park is an exceptionally well-maintained four-bedroom mid-terrace family home that has been lovingly cared for by its current owners. Offering bright, spacious and versatile accommodation throughout, together with a private front driveway and a large low-maintenance rear garden, this impressive property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers seeking a home in walk-in condition.\r\n\r\nOn arrival, you are immediately greeted by a property that has been meticulously maintained, with an attractive façade and private off-street parking to the front. A welcoming entrance porch leads into a bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area that has been tastefully updated to create a modern family living space. The contemporary fitted kitchen is centred around a stylish island and offers an abundance of both base and eye-level storage units along with generous worktop space, making it ideal for everyday family life and entertaining. The living area is further enhanced by a feature fireplace, creating a warm and inviting focal point.\r\n\r\nMoving through the property, a rear hallway provides direct access to the generous rear garden, which has been designed with low maintenance in mind and benefits from rear pedestrian access. A substantial block-built shed provides excellent additional storage, while the hallway itself has been thoughtfully fitted as a practical laundry area, making full use of the available space.\r\n\r\nAlso located on the ground floor is a spacious room currently used as a home office but equally suitable as a fourth bedroom. This versatile room comfortably accommodates a double bed, making it an ideal guest bedroom, children's room or space for those working from home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers three further generously proportioned bedrooms together with a fully tiled family bathroom. Each room is filled with natural light and offers comfortable accommodation, making this an ideal home for growing families. Throughout the property, the high standard of maintenance and care shown by the current owners is immediately evident, allowing the successful purchaser to move in and enjoy their new home from day one.\r\n\r\nButtercup Park enjoys an excellent location in the heart of Dublin 17, with an extensive range of local amenities available within easy reach. Residents benefit from nearby neighbourhood shops, supermarkets, cafés, sporting facilities and parks, while both Northside Shopping Centre and Clarehall Shopping Centre are only a short drive away, offering an excellent selection of retail and dining options.\r\n\r\nThe area is particularly well suited to families, with a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools located nearby, including St. Francis of Assisi National School, Scoil Bhríde, Chanel College and Coolock Community College. Excellent public transport links are available, with several Dublin Bus routes serving the area and providing regular access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding suburbs. The nearby M1 and M50 motorways offer superb connectivity throughout Dublin and beyond, while Dublin Airport is located approximately 8 kilometres away, making it reachable in approximately 10 to 15 minutes by car.\r\n\r\nCombining spacious accommodation, modern family living and an exceptionally convenient location, 107 Buttercup Park represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a superb family home in one of Dublin 17's most established residential neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
